    "title": "North Korea behind $6.3 billion Binance crypto theft, Blockchain analysis firm TRM says | World News",
    "text": "How North Korean hackers allegedly stole the crypto?\nTRM explained how the North Korean hackers allegedly stole cryptocurrency from Binance. “On Ethereum, the attacker used an EIP-7702 delegation to turn a Binance hot wallet into a sweeper it controlled, with 50 pre-signed authorizations prepared in advance. In the same window, Binance wallets on the other nine chains sent funds to the attacker through ordinary signed transfers,” they noted.",
